\newlabel{fig:pderivbc-rust}{{6.3}{44}{The alternation and sequence arms of \texttt {pderiv\_bc}, transcribing $\mathsf {PB}_{+}$, $\mathsf {PB}_{\mathrm {seq}}$ and $\mathsf {PB}_{\mathrm {seq}}^{\,n}$}{figure.caption.26}{}}
